      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.02,
      "end_seconds": 24.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Alright, how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.85,
      "end_seconds": 26.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "About... well, six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.57,
      "end_seconds": 32.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Okay, and and what about chest pain or cough?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.17,
      "end_seconds": 38.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "I, I haven't had chest pain or cough, no"
    },
